#. <CLT 4>時計で時間を知ったところで…
#. なんか虚しくなるだけだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Sure, I can look at the clock and see what \"time\" it\n"
"is. But what's the point?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>本来の教室なら窓があるべき場所だけど…
#. そこには、やっぱり鉄板が打ち付けられている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is where a window would be in a normal classroom.\n"
"But there's some huge metal plate mounted over it now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この階も鉄板で覆われてる…
#. まったく…ウンザリだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This floor has been sealed up with sheets of metal,\n"
"too. I'm so sick of this...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>本来の教室なら窓があるべき場所だけど…
#. そこには、やっぱり鉄板が打ち付けられている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is where a window would be in a normal classroom.\n"
"But there's some huge metal plate mounted over it now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こっちも鉄板…あっちも鉄板か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Metal plate here... Metal plate over there, too.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Tấm kim loại ở đây... Tấm kim loại ở kia.\n"
"<CLT>"

#. はい
msgctxt "0006 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0007 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. はい
msgctxt "0009 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

